# Changelog

All notable changes to this project. Format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/); versions follow [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).

Two changelogs exist and they are not the same thing (skip this table and use one bundled file instead if this repo's own convention already works that way — see the app-init skill's `references/process-scaffolding.md` Step 4):

| File | Records | Update when |
|---|---|---|
| **CHANGELOG.md** (this file) | What shipped, per release | Every user-visible or operational change |
| [docs/spec-changelog.md](docs/spec-changelog.md) | How the *specification* changed | The product spec version is bumped |

Every entry must state the **user-visible effect**, not the implementation.

